# Live game tracking (EventTrinket). Upstream ships this file with a real,
# live databaseURL/projectId/apiKey for their `draft-trinket` Firebase
# project - see `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-19-eventtrinket-life-tracking-design.md`.
#
# Deliberately left blank in this fork: populating all three makes
# isTrackingConfigured() true and this build would start writing tracked
# games into *upstream's* Firebase project, which we have no permission to
# do. To enable tracking for this fork, point these at your own Firebase
# Realtime Database project instead (unrelated to hosting - stays on
# Cloudflare Pages either way).
VITE_TRACK_DATABASE_URL=
VITE_TRACK_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_TRACK_API_KEY=
